    <string name="privacy_consent_title">Before Gemini voice mode</string>
    <string name="privacy_consent_body">Gemini Live is a cloud service. When you start a voice session, your microphone audio is streamed to Google’s servers to be processed and JARVIS plays back the generated speech.

JARVIS never attaches your files, photos, messages, notifications, contacts, clipboard or location to that stream, and it never records or uploads audio outside a session you started. Local Privacy mode never contacts Google at all.</string>
